# Pairs with AtomicOnOwner. The saga records its decision once any entry is
# dispatched rather than every one, so readers see a committed batch with one
# key staged and the other not.
MODULE: AtomicOnOwnerRetainedDecidesEarly
TARGET: AtomicOnOwner
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the decision is recorded once any entry is dispatched, so readers see the batch torn
PERTURBS: SagaDecide

--- FIND
SagaDecide ==
    /\ sg = "exec"
    /\ prepped = Keys
--- REPLACE
SagaDecide ==
    /\ sg = "exec"
\* MUTATION: any dispatched entry is enough.
    /\ prepped # {}
--- END
